SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> obo:BFO_0000004)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000108 obo:BFO_0000008))
