# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> (mold)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> "mold"@en-us)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> "mould"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> "A device consisting of a hollowed-out cavity that shapes fluid or plastic material into a specific form through the process of solidification or cooling."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> (geological process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> "geological process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> "A natural process that operates within the Earth system to transform, transport, or deform Earth materials, thereby changing Earth structures and landforms"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000110> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> (OBSOLETE ASTM grainsize)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "ASTM-Korngröße"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "OBSOLETE ASTM grainsize"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "Die ASTM-Korngröße ist eine Qualität, die durch ein Verfahren gemessen wird, das dem ASTM-Standard folgt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "The ASTM grain size is a quality that is measured through a process that follows the ASTM standard."@en)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> (DEPRECATED Aggregatzustand)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> "Make bearer entity member of subclass of 'portion of matter in aggregate state'")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> "DEPRECATED Aggregatzustand"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> "DEPRECATED aggregate state"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> "DEPRECATED a quality representing the physical state of a material, such as solid, liquid, or gasous"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000512> "DEPRECATED eine intensive Qualität, die den physikalischen Zustand eines Materials darstellt, z. B. fest, flüssig oder gasförmig"@de)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> (flow of electric charge)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> "Fluss elektrischer Ladung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> "flow of electric charge"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> "is the process of movement of charged particles"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> "ist der Prozess der Bewegung geladener Teilchen"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000519> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> (heat flow)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> "Wärmefluss"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> "heat flow"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> "is a process in which transfer of thermal energy between or within material entities occurs"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> "ist ein Prozess, bei dem Wärmeenergie zwischen oder innerhalb materieller Einheiten übertragen wird"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> (generation of magnetic field)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "Erzeugung eines Magnetfeldes"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "generation of magnetic field"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "is a process that occurs as a reaction to change of elctric field or movement of charges and produces a magnetic field"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "ist ein Prozess, der als Reaktion auf eine Änderung des elektrischen Feldes oder die Bewegung von Ladungen abläuft und ein magnetisches Feld erzeugt"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> (mechanical process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "mechanical process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "mechanischer Prozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "is a process in which forces, moments, or imposed displacements to objects or object aggregates occur and/or the equivalent (stresses, strains) to materials or portions of matter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "ist ein Prozess, bei dem Kräfte, Momente oder auferlegte Verschiebungen auf Objekte oder Objektaggregate und/oder das Äquivalent (Spannungen, Dehnungen) auf Materialien oder Teile der Materie auftreten"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> (assembling process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> "Assemblierungsprozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> "assembling process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> "An assembling process is a manufacturing process that mounts or demounts components."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000538> (bulk)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000538> "bulk"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000538> "a fiat object part that describes the inner part of a somewhat homogenous object, often in contrast to its surface layer"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000538> obo:BFO_0000024)
