# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> (change of temperature)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> "Temperaturänderung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> "change of temperature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> "Temperaturänderung ist ein Prozess, bei dem ein Teilnehmer seine Temperatur ändert"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> "change of temperature is a process in which a particpant changes its temperature"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> (chemische Zusammensetzung)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> "See the editor note of composition to understand the difference between composition and chemical composition.

See the pattern example of composition to underatand the difference between composition and proportion."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> "chemical composition"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> "chemische Zusammensetzung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> "Die chemische Zusammensetzung ist eine intensive Eigenschaft eines Materieteils, die die Arten und Anteile reiner chemischer Elemente in dem Materieteil beschreibt, und ist Gegenstand einiger Datenelemente zur chemischen Zusammensetzung."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> "The chemical composition is an intensive quality of a portion of matter which describes the types and proportions of pure chemical elements in the portion of matter, and it is a subject of some chemical composition data item."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000080 ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000051 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020140>))))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> (chemical potential)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> "chemical potential"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> "chemisches Potential"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> "a quality of a thermodynamic system describing the energy change associated with the addition of a small quantity of a substance to a system at constant temperature and pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> "eine intensive Qualität eines thermodynamischen Systems, die die Energieänderung beschreibt, die mit der Zugabe einer kleinen Menge einer Substanz zu einem System bei konstanter Temperatur und konstantem Druck verbunden ist."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080116>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> (composite)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> "composite"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> "An object aggregate that consists of two or more bonded materials with dissimilar physical or chemical properties which are used to complement each other where the parts remain seperate and distinct in the resulting object aggregate."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> "carbon fibre reinforced polymer
laminated glass
wood
hard metal composites for abrasive tools")
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000890>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> (Rechenprozess)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> "Rechenprozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> "computing process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> "A process that involves the systematic use of computational methods and tools to perform simulations, analyses, or data transformations to achieve specific scientific or engineering goals."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> "Ein Prozess, der die systematische Verwendung von rechnerischen Methoden und Werkzeugen umfasst, um Simulationen, Analysen oder Datenumwandlungen durchzuführen, um spezifische wissenschaftliche oder technische Ziele zu erreichen."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> obo:COB_0000035)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:OBI_0000293 obo:IAO_0000030) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:OBI_0000299 obo:IAO_0000030)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> (Kristallstruktur)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> "The finite set of periodic geometric arrangements is described e.g. by the 14 possible Bravais Lattices in three-dimensional space."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> "Kristallstruktur"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> "OBSOLETE crystal structure"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> "an intensive quality of a crystal that embodies the periodic geometric arrangement of entities in a crystal lattice."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000591> "eine intensive Kristallqualität, die die periodische geometrische Anordnung von Einheiten in einem Kristallgitter verkörpert."@de)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> (Defektdichte)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "Defektdichte"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "defect density"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "an intensive quality describing the number of defects per unit volume or area in a material, which can affect its mechanical and electronic properties"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "eine intensive Qualität, die die Anzahl der Defekte pro Volumen- oder Flächeneinheit in einem Material beschreibt, die sich auf seine mechanischen und elektronischen Eigenschaften auswirken können"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)

