AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000773> "hardness"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000773> "The hardness is a mechanical property used as a measure of a material's resistance to localized plastic deformation, often tested by indentation or scratch methods."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000773> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023004>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000773> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020335> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000052 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020293>)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> (Wärmekapazität)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> "Wärmekapazität"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> "heat capacity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> "Die Wärmekapazität ist eine thermische Eigenschaft, die die Menge an Wärmeenergie beschreibt, die erforderlich ist, um die Temperatur einer Entität um einen bestimmten Betrag zu erhöhen."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> "The heat capacity is a thermal property describing the amount of heat energy required to raise the temperature of an entity by a given amount."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> obo:BFO_0000017)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020313>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000777> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000054 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> (Brechung)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> "e.g., air into glass"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> "Brechung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> "optical refraction"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> "Optical property which describes the bending of light as it passes from one medium into another due to a change in the light’s speed."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> "Optische Eigenschaft, die die Ablenkung des Lichts beim Übergang von einem Medium in ein anderes aufgrund einer Änderung der Lichtgeschwindigkeit beschreibt."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000790> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000877>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000794> (injection molding machine)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000794> "Spritzgießmaschine"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000794> "injection molding machine"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000794> "An injection molding machine is a device used to produce plastic parts by injecting molten plastic into molds under high pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000794> "Eine Spritzgießmaschine ist ein Gerät, das verwendet wird, um Kunststoffteile durch Einspritzen von geschmolzenem Kunststoff in Formen unter hohem Druck herzustellen."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000794> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> (Absorption von Strahlung)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> "Absorption von Strahlung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> "absorption of radiation"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> "Prozess der Aufnahme von Strahlung durch ein materielles Wesen"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> "process of taking up radiation by a material entity"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> (manufacturing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "Manufacturing processes alternate qualities of materials, i.e., a value specification of some quality of a material entity, which is a specified input to the process, cannot be the same as a value specification of the same quality of another material entity, which is a specified output of the process. 

Unfortunately it is not possible to write down such axiom based on OWL. Semi-working solution are the temporally qualified continuants + SPARQL constrains."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "Herstellungsprozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "manufacturing process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "A planned process that is driven by the primary intent to transform objects
A manufacturing process is always a transformative process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "Ein geplannter Prozess, der von der primären Absicht angetrieben wird, Objekte zu transformieren. Ein Herstellungsprozess ist immer ein Transformationsprozess."@de)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:COB_0000035 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:OBI_0000293 ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000027 obo:BFO_0000030)) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:OBI_0000299 ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000027 obo:BFO_0000030))))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> obo:COB_0000035)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:OBI_0000293 ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000027 obo:BFO_0000030)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:OBI_0000299 ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000027 obo:BFO_0000030)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000845> (matrix role)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000845> "matrix role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000845> "Matrix is the role of a 'PortionOfConnectedMatter' that implies to host the Filler."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000845> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020335>)
