# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> (stiffness)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> "Steifigkeit"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> "stiffness"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> "The stiffness is an object property describing the resistance of the object to deformation under an applied force."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020317>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020311> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000052 obo:BFO_0000030) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002328 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002328 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020200>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000949> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> (DEPRECATED stimulating process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> "Might come back later with appropriate axioms")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> "DEPRECATED anregender Prozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> "DEPRECATED stimulating process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> "DEPRECATED Der Stimulationsprozess ist ein Prozess, der die Anwendung eines äußeren Einflusses wie Kraft, Wärme oder Strahlung beschreibt, um die materielle Reaktion zu untersuchen."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000950> "DEPRECATED The stimulating process is a process describing the application of an external influence, such as force, heat, or radiation, to study material response."@en)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> (strength)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> "Festigkeit"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> "strength"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> "is a material property describing the stress before a characteristic (failure-) event occurs."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020335>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023004>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000952> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectUnionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000054 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000015 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000117 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020258>))) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000052 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068>)) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000052 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002328 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020200>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002328 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080019>)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> (surface layer (fiat object part))

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> "Oberflächenschicht (Fiat-Objektteil)"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> "surface layer (fiat object part)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> "A surface layer (fiat object part) is a fiat object part that is part of only object. The surface layer is the three dimensional region defining the outermost layer of an object, where surface-interactions with other material entities occur. What is considered as the surface is thus defined by the interaction process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> "Eine Oberflächenschicht (Fiat-Objektteil) ist ein Fiat-Objektteil, der nur Teil eines Objekts ist. Die Oberflächenschicht ist der dreidimensionale Bereich, der die äußerste Schicht eines Objekts definiert, wo Oberflächeninteraktionen mit anderen materiellen Einheiten stattfinden. Was als Oberfläche betrachtet wird, wird somit durch den Interaktionsprozess definiert."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> "When considering optical properties of a surface layer (fiat object part) of a polished piece of metal we likely consider a different three dimensional spatial region than when considering the scratch hardness properties of the same polished piece of metal."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> obo:BFO_0000024)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> ObjectAllValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000027 obo:BFO_0000030)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> (temperature)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "The concept refers to an absolute temperature, not to be mistaken with temperature difference."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "To express that an object has a temperature, the property 'intensive bearer of' can be used. It implies a chain of: object consists of some portion of matter and portion of matter bearer of some temperature."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "Temperatur"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "temperature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "Die Temperatur ist eine grundlegende intensive Qualität, die die durchschnittliche atomare oder molekulare Bewegung oder Schwingung eines Teils der Materie darstellt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "The temperature is a fundamental intensive quality representing the average atomic or molcular movement or vibration of a portion of matter."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023043>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> (thermal property)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> "thermal property"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> "thermische Eigenschaft"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> "A thermal property is a material property representing attributes of a material that describe its behavior under temperature changes, such as thermal conductivity and expansion."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> "Eine thermische Eigenschaft ist eine Materialeigenschaft, die Attribute eines Materials darstellt, die sein Verhalten bei Temperaturänderungen beschreiben, wie z. B. Wärmeleitfähigkeit und Ausdehnung."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> "Refractory bricks have a high thermal capability, withstanding furnace temperatures above 1600 C"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> obo:BFO_0000017)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000981> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000054 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000520>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001008> (absorption of wave radiation)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001008> "Absorption von Wellenstrahlung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001008> "absorption of wave radiation"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001008> "Vorgang der Aufnahme elektromagnetischer Strahlung durch ein materielles Wesen"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001008> "process of taking up elctromagnetic radiation by a material entity"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001008> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001036> (uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001036> "uncertainty"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001036> "A quantitative indication of the doubt about a measurement result, expressing the range within which the true value is expected to lie.")
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001036> obo:IAO_0000030)

