# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020003> (crystal)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020003> "crystal"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020003> "A crystal is an object that has a quality \"crystal structure\"."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020003> obo:BFO_0000030)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> (composition data item)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> "These portions of other matters do not have to be portions of specific chemical elements, i.e., atomic composition, but rather portions of other substances, such as nitric acid and water."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> "composition data item"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:altLabel <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> "composition specification"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> "Bei einem Zusammensetzungsdatenelement handelt es sich um eine Informationsinhaltseinheit, die sich mit der Zusammensetzung einer materiellen Einheit befasst. Es verfügt über Bruchwertspezifikationen für Mitglieder, die Werte von Anteilen von Verbindungen angeben, die Teile der materiellen Einheit sind."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> "Composition data entity is an information content entity that is about composition of a material enity. It has members fraction value specifications which specifiy values of propotions of compounds, which are parts of the material enity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> "Nitric acid solution has quality  composition, and  the composition data item is about this composition.The composition data item has members fraction specifications of nitric acid, e.g., 4 vol.%, and distilled water. These fraction specifications specify value of pure substances of nitric acid and distilled water, respectively. Furthermore, these fraction specifications specify values of relational qualities (volume) proportion of nitric acid and (volume) proportion of distilled water."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:IAO_0000027 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:IAO_0000136 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002351 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025997>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020005> (porosity)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020005> "porosity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020005> "itensive quality embodiying the fraction of the materials (enclosing) spatial region occupied by pores."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020005> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> (corrosion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> "Corrosion is typically of interest when the change of the material affects the objects ability to fulfill its function."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> "Korrosion"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> "corrosion"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> "Korrosion ist ein langsamer chemischer oder elektrochemischer Zersetzungsprozess eines Materials aufgrund seiner Wechselwirkung mit der Umgebung."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> "corrosion is a slow chemical or electrochemical degradation process of a material entity due to its interaction with the surrounding environment."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> obo:BFO_0000015)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020022> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025013> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000080 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000040 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000091 obo:BFO_0000016))))))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020023> (OBSOLETE metallic grain structures)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020023> "OBSOLETE metallic grain structures"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020023> "metallische Kornstrukturen"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020023> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020023> "Bei der metallischen Kornstruktur handelt es sich um eine kategoriale Wertspezifikation, die den Wert der Qualität der metallischen Kornstruktur angibt. Es beschreibt die Morphologie polykristalliner metallischer Werkstoffe. Polykristalline metallische Materialien bilden ihre Kornstrukturen typischerweise als eine dieser Kategorien oder als Übergangs- oder Mischungszustand davon aus."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020023> "The metallic grain structures is a categorical value specification that specifies value of the  metallic grain structure quality. It describes the morphology of polycrystalline metallic materials. Polycrystalline metallic materials will typically form their grain structures as one of those categories or a transition or mixture state of those."@en)

