AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020026> "A 'portion of iron' is a 'Poriton Of Pure Substance' that 'consists of' only chebi:iron atom."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020026> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020140> ObjectAllValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000051 obo:CHEBI_18248)))
