AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "a relational quality expressing a mass of a part in relation to the the mass of the whole"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "A fiber-reinforced composite has a fiber mass fraction of 60/100 and a matrix mass fraction of 40/100."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> ObjectUnionOf(ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0060002> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025997> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:IAO_0000039 obo:UO_1000163)))) ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> ObjectExactCardinality(1 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020256> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000001 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000086 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020133>))) ObjectExactCardinality(1 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020257> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000001 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000086 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020133>))))))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> (molar fraction)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "molar fraction"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:altLabel <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "count per count"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Molar fraction is the fraction which quantifies the entities count of the part in relation to the entities count of the whole."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "The molar fraction of carbon dioxide molecules to average atmosphere air molecules is 420 ppm as of 2022 AD."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> ObjectUnionOf(ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0060002> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025997> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:IAO_0000039 obo:UO_1000076)))) ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> ObjectExactCardinality(1 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020256> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000001 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000086 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020367>))) ObjectExactCardinality(1 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020257> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000001 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000086 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020367>))))))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101>)

