AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> "A thermodynamic system is a material entity whose parts are bearer of thermodynamic properties. A thermodynamic system environs a thermodynamic process by which the thermodynamic properties of the objects of the thermodynamic system change over time."@en)
