# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> (spatial extend)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "spatial extend"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "Dimension quality is a quality of a material entity that pertains to its measurable spatial extent, such as length, area, or volume"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:example <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "the wall thickness of a steel pipe is a dimension quality functionally related to its pressure resistance"@en)
