AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020136> "A thermodynamic phase transformation is a process in/of a thermodynamic system, that involves the transformation of phases of the system to other phases."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020136> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> (lot)

