AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> "A lot is an object aggregate whose parts are output of the same production process."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> obo:BFO_0000027)

