# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020143> (process chain)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020143> "process chain"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020143> "A process chain is a process that 'has continuant part' subprocesses S1...Sn where S1...Sn precede each other and where some object or object aggregate that are output of Sn are then input to Sn+1."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020143> obo:BFO_0000015)

