# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020151> (internal energy)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020151> "innere Energie"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020151> "internal energy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020151> "Innere Energie ist eine universelle umfassende Qualität, die das Potenzial des Trägers zur Arbeit festlegt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020151> "Internal energy is a universal extensive quality that specifies the bearers potential to do work."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020151> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020142>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> (activity (thermodynamic))

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> "activity (thermodynamic)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> "thermodynamische Aktivität"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> "Thermodynamic activity is a relational quality that inheres between a chemical species and a non-ideal solution and represents the effective concentration of the species accounting for particle interactions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> "Thermodynamische Aktivität ist eine Beziehungsqualität, die zwischen einer chemischen Spezies und einer nicht idealen Lösung innewohnt und die effektive Konzentration der Spezies darstellt, die für Partikelwechselwirkungen verantwortlich ist."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> obo:BFO_0000019)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020313>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023004>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020161> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000080 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CHEBI_60003 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000087 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020227>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002350 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020229>))))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020162> (Aktivierungsenergie)

