AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020162> "activation energy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020162> "Activation energy (E_a) a process attribute characterizing the minimum amount of energy required to initiate a reaction, allowing educts to overcome an energy barrier to transform into products."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020162> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008>)

