SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000066 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001>))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001028> ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000016 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000005>)))

