EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0090012> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002353 obo:GO_0008150)))
