# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> (Triklines Primitiv des Bravais-Gitters)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice triclinic primitive"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> "Triklines Primitiv des Bravais-Gitters"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> "triclinic Bravais lattice with primitive centering (aP), having no rotational symmetry and all three unit cell axes of unequal length meeting at oblique angles"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> "triklines Bravais-Gitter mit primitiver Zentrierung (aP), keine Rotationssymmetrie und alle drei Elementarzellenachsen ungleicher Länge treffen sich in schrägen Winkeln"@de)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> (OBSOLETE bravais lattice monoclinic primitive)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice monoclinic primitive"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> "monoklines Grundelement des Bravais-Gitters"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> "Monoklines Bravais-Gitter mit primitiver Zentrierung (mP) mit einer zweizähligen Rotationsachse mit einem schiefen Winkel und zwei rechten Winkeln zwischen den Achsen der Elementarzellen"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> "monoclinic Bravais lattice with primitive centering (mP), having one 2-fold rotation axis with one oblique angle and two right angles between unit cell axes"@en)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> (Bravais-Gitter monoklin basiszentriert)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> "Bravais-Gitter monoklin basiszentriert"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice monoclinic base-centered"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> "monoclinic Bravais lattice with base-centered centering (mC), having one 2-fold rotation axis and additional lattice points at the center of one pair of faces"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> "monoklines Bravais-Gitter mit basiszentrierter Zentrierung (mC), einer zweizähligen Rotationsachse und zusätzlichen Gitterpunkten in der Mitte eines Flächenpaares"@de)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> (Bravais-Gitter orthorombisches Grundelement)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> "Bravais-Gitter orthorombisches Grundelement"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorombic primitive"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> "orthorhombic Bravais lattice with primitive centering (oP), having three mutually perpendicular 2-fold rotation axes and one lattice point per unit cell"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> "orthorhombisches Bravais-Gitter mit primitiver Zentrierung (oP), mit drei zueinander senkrechten zweizähligen Rotationsachsen und einem Gitterpunkt pro Elementarzelle"@de)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> (OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorhombic base-centered)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> "Bravais-Gitter orthorhombisch basiszentriert"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorhombic base-centered"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> "orthorhombic Bravais lattice with base-centered centering (oC), having three perpendicular 2-fold axes and additional lattice points at the centers of one pair of faces"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> "orthorhombisches Bravais-Gitter mit basiszentrierter Zentrierung (oC), mit drei senkrechten zweizähligen Achsen und zusätzlichen Gitterpunkten in den Mittelpunkten eines Flächenpaares"@de)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> (OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorhombic body-centered)

